ows.",id:"V+/it1JIkX"},viewerLoadFailedAgain:{defaultMessage:"Part of this page still isn’t downloading. If retrying doesn’t help, reload the preview or the page. It may have been updated since this one opened.",description:"Body of the error card titled “Couldn’t load the viewer”, after the Retry button has failed too. “The preview” is the artifact or file preview that holds the card; “the page” is the browser page around it. “It” is that page, of which a newer version may have been released.",id:"HVK34dAI+k"},zoomIn:{defaultMessage:"Zoom in",id:"xbi38cl5pP"},zoomOut:{defaultMessage:"Zoom out",id:"/UnJ3SDiCO"},exitFullScreen:{defaultMessage:"Exit full screen",id:"gYg6LXT1SA"},enterFullScreen:{defaultMessage:"Enter full screen",description:"Tooltip and screen-reader label of an icon button under the zoom buttons on a diagram or drawing; makes it fill the whole screen. The same button then says “Exit full screen”.",id:"MAvpFx5EVU"},pdfPageLoading:{defaultMessage:"Loading page {pageNumber}...",description:"Shown in the empty space of one page of a PDF, Word or PowerPoint preview while that page is being drawn. {pageNumber} is the page’s number, counted from 1.",id:"OqzPMsScBl"},pdfPageFailed:{defaultMessage:"Unable to display page {pageNumber}",description:"Shown in place of one page of a PDF, Word or PowerPoint preview that could not be drawn. {pageNumber} is the page’s number, counted from 1.",id:"XPEql2KY69"},pdfPageBadge:{defaultMessage:"Page {pageNumber} / {totalPages}",description:"Small badge in the corner of every page of a PDF, Word or PowerPoint preview. {pageNumber} is this page’s number; {totalPages} is how many pages the file has. Keep it short.",id:"qbrNt2nXvw"},pdfLoadFailed:{defaultMessage:"Unable to load PDF file",description:"Heading shown in place of a PDF preview when the file could not be opened. Word and PowerPoint files are converted to PDF to be previewed, so they can show it too.",id:"Uw0b9+N/EW"},pdfMayBeCorrupted:{defaultMessage:"The PDF file may be corrupted or invalid.",description:"Line under the heading “Unable to load PDF file”, in place of a file preview.",id:"jxCIog3SSl"},pdfHasPassword:{defaultMessage:"This PDF has a password",description:"Heading shown in place of a PDF preview when the file needs a password to open, which the preview can’t ask for.",id:"PNebAszHQu"},pdfPasswordHint:{defaultMessage:"It can’t be shown here. Download it and open it where you can enter the password.",description:"Line under the heading “This PDF has a password”, in place of a file preview.",id:"qsjUmxAtXk"},documentLoadFailedTitle:{defaultMessage:"Failed to load document",description:"Heading shown in place of a Word or PowerPoint preview that could not be made. One sentence with the reason follows.",id:"Hyxro2NIxH"},documentTryAgain:{defaultMessage:"Unable to preview this document right now. Try again.",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”: a passing problem on the service’s side, not a fault in the Word or PowerPoint file.",id:"mEt3blQzIy"},documentConversionFailed:{defaultMessage:"Document conversion failed",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”: a Word or PowerPoint file is converted to PDF to be previewed, and the conversion failed with no further reason given.",id:"MUwAHrPHml"},documentContentRequired:{defaultMessage:"Document content is required",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”: the preview was given no file content to show.",id:"WVdrue3HQJ"},documentTooLarge:{defaultMessage:"Document size ({sizeMb}MB) exceeds maximum allowed size of {maxMb}MB",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”: the Word or PowerPoint file is too big to preview. {sizeMb} is its size and {maxMb} the limit, both whole numbers; MB is the unit, megabytes.",id:"adUmEXI4T1"},documentNetworkError:{defaultMessage:"Unable to load document. Check your network connection.",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”: the request to convert the Word or PowerPoint file, or the answer to it, did not get through.",id:"WPL103mpMh"},documentUnsupported:{defaultMessage:"Unable to preview this document. The file may be corrupted or in an unsupported format.",description:"Reason under the heading “Failed to load document”, for a Word or PowerPoint file, when nothing more is known.",id:"ZVPVhJqRcM"},excelLoadFailedTitle:{defaultMessage:"Failed to load Excel file",description:"Heading shown in place of an Excel spreadsheet preview that could not be opened. One line with the reason follows. Excel is Microsoft’s product name.",id:"Q1oiLSfjzb"},excelLoadFailed:{defaultMessage:"Failed to load Excel file",description:"Line under the heading of the same words, “Failed to load Excel file”, when no reason is known. Excel is Microsoft’s product name.",id:"qza0Iq48+K"},excelTooLargeTitle:{defaultMessage:"File is too large to preview",description:"Heading shown in place of an Excel spreadsheet preview when the workbook is too large for the preview to convert. Nothing follows it.",id:"7luEIdWE25"},excelDataTab:{defaultMessage:"Data",description:"Tab above an Excel spreadsheet preview; shows the sheets’ cells. The tab beside it, “Charts”, shows the workbook’s charts.",id:"CumU/rIRrL"},excelChartsTab:{defaultMessage:"Charts",description:"Tab above an Excel spreadsheet preview; shows the workbook’s charts. Their count follows the word. The tab beside it, “Data”, shows the cells.",id:"WopzEjM9Cv"},excelNoCharts:{defaultMessage:"No charts found in this Excel file",description:"Shown under the Charts tab of an Excel spreadsheet preview when the workbook has no chart that can be drawn. Excel is Microsoft’s product name.",id:"2b+iwwLemS"},excelChartFallbackTitle:{defaultMessage:"Excel chart",description:"Title over the only chart of an Excel spreadsheet preview, when the chart has no title of its own. Excel is Microsoft’s product name.",id:"WZqHVwoRQr"},excelChartNumbered:{defaultMessage:"Chart {number}",description:"Name of a chart with no title of its own, on its tab in an Excel spreadsheet preview that has several charts. {number} counts the charts from 1.",id:"vcGcYrPESD"},excelSeriesNumbered:{defaultMessage:"Series {number}",description:"Name in a chart’s legend for a data series that the Excel workbook leaves unnamed. {number} counts the chart’s series from 1.",id:"aR7kwJtPMf"},excelChartLabel:{defaultMessage:"{title}: {chartKind}",description:"Screen-reader label of a chart in an Excel spreadsheet preview. {title} is the chart’s title; {chartKind} is a phrase such as “bar chart”, translated on its own.",id:"NR7KSwICG2"},excelChartLabelWithSheet:{defaultMessage:"{title}: {chartKind}, sheet {sheetName}",description:"Screen-reader label of a chart in an Excel spreadsheet preview. {title} is the chart’s title; {chartKind} is a phrase such as “bar chart”, translated on its own; {sheetName} is the name of the worksheet that holds the chart.",id:"/KRdi3NmPO"},excelChartKindBar:{defaultMessage:"bar chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: bar chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"UL60m+wspJ"},excelChartKindLine:{defaultMessage:"line chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: line chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"fxa8yT/LSJ"},excelChartKindPie:{defaultMessage:"pie chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: pie chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"hjYGNw97+o"},excelChartKindDoughnut:{defaultMessage:"doughnut chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: doughnut chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"3fwESGJpaT"},excelChartKindScatter:{defaultMessage:"scatter chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: scatter chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"ifiRnpxv75"},excelChartKindRadar:{defaultMessage:"radar chart",description:"Kind of chart, read by screen readers after a chart’s title, as in “Sales: radar chart”. Lower case in English because it follows the colon.",id:"NGg6Kpik6b"},csvNoData:{defaultMessage:"No data available in this file",description:"Shown in place of a CSV or TSV file preview when the file has no rows.",id:"gkfSD229eO"},tableNoData:{defaultMessage:"No data available",id:"wOFJFONq4O"},tableRowNumbers:{defaultMessage:"Row numbers",description:"Screen-reader label of the empty corner cell that heads the column of row numbers, in the table of a CSV or TSV file preview.",id:"cgyV4zrD2s"},consoleTitle:{defaultMessage:"Console messages",description:"Heading of the panel under an HTML artifact that lists what the artifact’s code wrote to the browser console: logs, warnings and errors.",id:"CrxKhTY4xb"},consoleEarlierLinesDropped:{defaultMessage:"(earlier lines dropped)",description:"First line of the “Console messages” panel under an HTML artifact, once the list has grown too long and its oldest lines have been removed.",id:"dmV40rDfh1"},consoleResize:{defaultMessage:"Resize console messages",description:"Screen-reader label of the handle between an HTML artifact and the “Console messages” panel under it; dragging it resizes the panel.",id:"GYXcee8XWa"},htmlFrameTitle:{defaultMessage:"Rendered HTML content",description:"Screen-reader title of the frame in which an HTML artifact runs.",id:"zetf/eFtmC"},errorUnsupportedImportsTitle:{defaultMessage:"Artifact failed to load",id:"NcDXiSfIPe"},errorUnsupportedImportsDescription:{defaultMessage:"The generated artifact uses libraries we don’t support:",id:"HG0Hu8xIQA"},errorUnsupportedImportsSubtext:{defaultMessage:"The code itself may still work. To use it, you’ll need a development setup with these libraries installed.",id:"Et/uvuRBba"},errorRuntimeTitle:{defaultMessage:"Error running artifa